      'Eh-34': ['Yang Mound Spring', 'Earth point · master point of tendons and muscles', 'On the outer lower leg, in the hollow in front of and below the head of the fibula.', 'Muscle tension, cramps, knee tension.', 'Firm thumb pressure, 1 minute.', ''],
